 {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "id": 96, "type": "easy saveText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [106], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [287.4029235839844, 58], "pos": [-1571.232666015625, -483.7438659667969], "widgets_values": [0], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 105, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_index"}, "name": "image_index", "link": 107, "label": "image_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_index"}], "flags": {}, "id": 93, "type": "RHExtractImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHExtractImage"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [116, 120], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 276], "pos": [-2036.688720703125, -501.5631103515625], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "8-bit (Balanced)", "[For Batch Images] Describe each image individually.", "你是一个专业的LoRA训练图像标注师，请为人物图像生成详细的训练标签。严格按照以下规则生成：\n\n## 核心原则\n只描述人物**永久固定的特征**，不描述任何可变元素。\n\n## 必须详细描述的特征\n\n### 1. 面部特征（必须具体描述）\n- **眼睛**：形状（杏仁眼、圆眼、细长眼）、颜色（黑眼、棕眼）、特点（双眼皮、长睫毛）\n- **鼻子**：鼻型（高鼻梁、小巧鼻子、挺拔鼻子）、鼻尖形状\n- **嘴唇**：唇形（薄唇、厚唇、丰满唇）、嘴角特点\n- **脸型**：瓜子脸、圆脸、方脸、鹅蛋脸\n- **肤色**：白皙肤色、健康肤色、小麦肤色\n\n### 2. 发型特征（必须具体描述）\n- **长度**：短发、齐肩发、长发、及腰长发\n- **发型**：直发、卷发、波浪发、自然卷\n- **发色**：黑发、棕发、金发（根据实际）\n- **细节**：刘海类型（齐刘海、斜刘海、无刘海）、分发方式（中分、偏分）\n\n### 3. 身材特征（如果图像可见）\n- **体型**：苗条身材、匀称身材、标准身材\n- **比例**：修长身形、适中身高、标准头身比\n- **细节**：纤细手臂、修长双腿、优美颈线\n\n## 标注格式要求\n1. **开头**：必须用 `xw` 开头\n2. **语言**：简体中文\n3. **数量**：10-15个标签，确保特征描述充分\n4. **分隔**：英文逗号分隔\n5. **顺序**：重要性递减排列\n6. **质量标签**：必须包含至少3个质量词\n\n## 标签结构示例\nxf, [具体面部特征], [具体发型特征], [身材特征], [构图描述], [质量标签]\n## 正确与错误示例\n\n### 正确标注（详细具体）：\nxf, 杏仁形眼睛, 黑色瞳孔, 双眼皮, 高鼻梁, 薄嘴唇, 瓜子脸, 白皙肤色, 黑色长发, 齐刘海, 苗条身材, 修长身形, 高质量, 写实风格, 细节丰富, 最佳品质\n### 错误标注（过于笼统）：\nxf, 精致五官, 黑色头发, 修长身形, 高质量\n\n## 禁止描述的内容（可变元素）\n- ❌ 服装：穿什么衣服、鞋子、配饰\n- ❌ 背景：在哪里、什么环境\n- ❌ 姿势：站着、坐着、做什么动作\n- ❌ 表情：笑、哭、生气\n- ❌ 道具：拿着什么物品\n\n## 输出要求\n只输出一行标签文本，不要任何解释、前缀或后缀。\n\n现在请分析图像，生成详细的人物特征标签：", 512, false, 1028019742262319, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 91, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 83, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_QwenVL"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "images(as list)", "links": [105, 109], "label": "images(as list)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images(as list)"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [-2576.072021484375, -16.608911514282227], "widgets_values": ["2668fa0fb8c7c1b0b18a4bf34e3f1ac1b82c829c6ed203aa6bae64411c588058", "success", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "